  "id": "harm-avoidance",
  "term": "harm avoidance",
  "definition": "Harm avoidance is a personality trait marked by a tendency to steer away from situations seen as potentially dangerous. It is a motivational pattern tied to approach-avoidance behavior and is described as reflecting sensitivity to danger, more like enduring fearfulness than general anxiety.",
